Answer: Note that $v$ is an eigenvector of $vv^T$ with eigenvalue $v^Tv=\sum_{i=1}^nx_i^2$. Also, note that the matrix $vv^T$ has rank at most $1$, so all other eigenvalues of $vv^T$ are $0$ by the rank-nullity theorem. 
