{"input_text": "Question: $\displaystyle \frac{4}{20}$+$\displaystyle \frac{4.7}{20.30}$+$\displaystyle \frac{4.7.10}{20.30.40}$+... 
 Now  I  have  tried  to  solve  this  in  a  usual  way,  first  find  the  nth  term  $t_n$. 
